  "$comment": "Shell state uses actual env/timeline/session job-table values. Git is fixed read-only plumbing with exact status/diff/latest observations. Legacy display fields are bounded derived previews; absence/failure yields nullable facts and incomplete state, not a clean repository. --no-git does not spawn a command. latest_commit_limit is explicitly one. No descendant-quiescence or child deadline is promised by the Git collector."
